cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Automated Annotation Workflow for a Global Systematic Map of Salmon Aquaculture Research"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Haddaway
    given-names: Neal
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3902-2234"

repository-code: https://github.com/nealhaddaway/salmonscopingreview

abstract: >
  Reproducible workflow for automated annotation of bibliographic records
  from a global systematic map of salmon aquaculture research. The workflow
  generates species, geographic and hierarchical topic annotations using a
  combination of deterministic rule-based methods and large language models.

keywords:
  - evidence synthesis
  - systematic map
  - salmon aquaculture
  - text mining
  - annotation
  - R

license: MIT
